## Running integration tests

```bash
npx supabase start        # starts local Postgres, applies all migrations
npm run test:db           # runs supabase/tests/*.sql via pgTAP
npx supabase stop         # when done
```

Run only when changing migrations, RLS policies, or SECURITY DEFINER functions. NOT part of the pre-commit fast path.

## Pre-commit fast path (unchanged)

```
npm run typecheck && npm run typecheck:test && npm run test:run   # 169+ unit tests
```

After all 4 items done, both commands together cover the full suite:

```
npm run typecheck && npm run typecheck:test && npm run test:run
npx supabase start && npm run test:db && npx supabase stop
```
